    "durationMs": 116972,
    "finalText": "The implementation is complete and fully verified. \n\n**What I built** (workspace had no starter, so everything is new):\n\n- `app/` — FastAPI app: `routers/links.py` (endpoints), `models.py` (SQLAlchemy `Link` model), `schemas.py` (validation), `database.py` (engine/session from `DATABASE_URL`), `config.py` (pydantic-settings, rewrites the URL to the `postgresql+psycopg` driver since only psycopg 3 is installed)\n- `migrations/` — Alembic setup with an initial migration creating the `links` table\n- `start.sh` — applies `alembic upgrade head` then serves uvicorn in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`\n- `requirements.txt` — stack pins plus `fastapi==0.162.6`\n- `README.md` — includes a \"Starting the server\" section\n- `tests/test_api.py` — 10 pytest tests\n\n**Key behaviors verified end-to-end** (via pytest and live curl against `sh start.sh`):\n- `POST /links` returns 201 with `{\"code\", \"url\", \"clicks\": 0}`, stores the URL verbatim (case/query preserved), generates 8-char codes from `[A-Za-z0-9_-]` when omitted, 409 with `error` on duplicate custom codes (with a race-safe `IntegrityError` retry for generated codes)\n- `GET /links/{code}` 200/404, `GET /r/{code}` 302 with exact `Location` and an atomic `UPDATE clicks = clicks + 1 RETURNING url` (exactly one increment per hit), `GET /links` lists in ascending creation order with `total`\n- All failure modes — malformed JSON, missing/invalid `url`, invalid `code`, unknown codes — return JSON with an `error` field (422/404 as specified) via custom exception handlers\n- Persistence confirmed: killed and restarted the server, click counts and links survived; migration re-run is idempotent\n\nTest data was truncated afterward, so the database is clean for the automated suite."
